  {
   "id": "rc112_lambda_density",
   "title": "輕質混凝土 λ（依穩定後密度，表19.2.4.1(a)）",
   "src": "rc112",
   "clause": "19.2.4.1",
   "page": 335,
   "keywords": "lambda λ 輕質 單位重",
   "unit": "-",
   "output": "lambda",
   "latex": "\\lambda=0.75\\;(w_c\\le1600);\\;0.0075w_c\\le1.0\\;(1600<w_c\\le2160);\\;1.0\\;(w_c>2160)",
   "vars": {
    "wc": {
     "desc": "穩定後密度 wc",
     "unit": "kg/m3",
     "min": 800,
     "max": 2600
    }
   },
   "expr": "0.75 if wc<=1600 else (1.0 if wc>2160 else min(0.0075*wc,1.0))",
   "notes": "常重混凝土 λ=1.0（19.2.4.3）；輕質混凝土未做詳細判定時得取 0.75（19.2.4.2）；亦可依表19.2.4.1(b)以粒料組成決定（未收錄）。",
